.vscode

# Terraform working directories hold the downloaded provider cache — ~865 MB for
# terraform/sandbox alone. prod.Dockerfile copies terraform/sandbox into the
# image, so without this the provider binaries ship too, and every build (dev
# included) pays the cost of sending them to the daemon.
#
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT excluded: the image should pin the same
# provider versions that were tested.
**/.terraform
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

